  "title": "Design Settings » Footer Design | Brilliant Directories Documentation | BD Support",
  "content": "Design Settings » Footer Design Link: https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000046628 Footer Design This article reviews all the settings available to edit the Footer of the Website. To access this section navigate to: Settings Design Settings General Footer Design Visual Guide of the Footer Design 1. Display Footer This setting will hide or display the footer of the website. 2. Background Color This setting controls the background color of the website 3. Section Title Color This setting controls the color of the Sections Title in the footer of the website. 4. Font & Link Color This setting controls the color of the Font and the Links in the footer of the website 5. Link Hover Color This setting controls the hover color of links in the footer of the website. 6. Signup Button Background This setting controls the background color for the signup button in the footer of the website. 7. Signup Button Font Color This setting controls the color of the font of the sign up button, in the footer of the website. 8. Display Social Icons This setting controls if the Social Icons are displayed or not. 9. Social Icons Style This setting controls the style of the Social Icons. Footer Newsletter Bar This section of settings controls the Newsletter Bar that displays on top of the footer of the website. 10. Display Newsletter Form This setting controls if the newsletter subscription form is hidden or displayed on the website. 11. Newsletter Bar Background This setting controls the background color of the newsletter bar, that displays on top of the footer of the website. 12. Button Background This setting controls the button background color that is used in the Newsletter Bar that displays on top of the footer of the website. 13. Button Font Color This setting controls the color of the font of the button used on the Newsletter Bar that displays on top of the footer of the website. For additional assistance: Email support@brilliantdirectories.com or create a ticket Inside Your Account Dashboard . Was this article helpful and accurate? Yes No Send feedback Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
